      <h2>6. UAE ports and fulfilment-centre destinations</h2>
      <p>
        The UAE ocean inbound usually lands at Jebel Ali, Khalifa or Port Khalid, then moves by truck
        to an Amazon or noon FC or a third-party prep warehouse. The verified snapshot does not publish
        FC addresses, so the table identifies roles rather than street-level destinations.
      </p>

